  "confirmedFeatures": [
    "Student lunch declaration (default route)",
    "Chef kitchen forecast (#/chef route)",
    "Chef forecast: expected customers and menu quantities are independent forecasts (no cross-field comparison in UI)",
    "Service closeout (#/service-closeout): wasteMeasurement ACTIVITY mapper; inbound chefForecast read model via INPUT_COLLECTIONS",
    "Three always-visible meal sections: Regular lunch, Soup lunch, No lunch",
    "Single active section; switching clears other sections quantities",
    "Portion quantities for main, vegetarian, soup, dessert (0 = not selected)",
    "Tomorrow lunch date targeting",
    "Dated Excel menu (calendar lookup, four slots per day)",
    "Europe/Helsinki submission window (18:00 on-time, 23:00 late close)",
    "Chef forecast deadline configurable in src/config/chef.ts (default 23:00)",
    "Points 20 base +5 on-time / -5 late (25 / 15 total) — student only",
    "One final submit per date; no update flow in UI",
    "localStorage persistence for standalone student demo",
    "GitHub Pages build base /raise-food-waste-minigames/",
    "GameBus embed ACTIVITY for studentLunchCheckin (twelve-property mapper)",
    "GameBus embed ACTIVITY for chefForecast (twelve required + two optional property mapper)",
    "GameBus embed ACTIVITY for wasteMeasurement (fifteen required properties — service closeout)",
    "Category placeholder images with optional dedicated public/images/menu/items/*.webp",
    "Excel menu inspect/convert/check CLI",
    "CI: Node 20, tsc, vitest (219 tests), build"
